# Scan output against live infrastructure — never commit. Anchored: an
# unanchored `results/` also swallows contract/snapshot/results/, whose findings
# are synthetic and redacted and MUST be committed.
/results/

# Rendered target lists and discovery output — derived from the JSON inventory.
/.gen/

# The nuclei-targets skill is a project deliverable. A global ~/.config/git/ignore
# excludes all .claude/ dirs, so re-include just the skill (not local settings).
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
